    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Repository timings",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Immich exports one count and one duration per repository method (about 100 metrics, for example `immich_asset_repository_get_by_id_duration_*`). Prometheus cannot sum them in one query, so they are not on this dashboard. In Explore, a single method's average is `rate(immich_asset_repository_get_by_id_duration_sum[5m]) / rate(immich_asset_repository_get_by_id_duration_count[5m])`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About these metrics",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Immich exports only the metrics above in this setup (`IMMICH_TELEMETRY_INCLUDE=all`). Job queues, uploads and per-endpoint request timings are not available from this version."
      }
    }
